			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>Wannan dubawa tana nuna layi har %2$@, amma wannan fayil yana da fiye da haka. Buɗe shi a cikin manhajar gyara rubutu don karanta shi gaba ɗaya.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>Wannan dubawa tana nuna layuka har %2$@, amma wannan fayil yana da fiye da haka. Buɗe shi a cikin manhajar gyara rubutu don karanta shi gaba ɗaya.</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
