			<key>other</key>
			<string>Wannan dubawa tana karanta takardu masu abubuwa har %2$@, amma wannan takardar tana da fiye da haka. Buɗe fayil ɗin a cikin manhajar da aka ƙera don irin wannan fayil.</string>
